From a9d187ddb4640d6efba6c61b421f327d1633ce79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ake Rehnman <ake.rehnman@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:03:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ui/dmabuf: support external-only EGL texture imports

Query modifier import requirements and track the texture target on each
DMA-BUF. Import external-only buffers as GL_TEXTURE_EXTERNAL_OES when a
consumer permits it, and report EGL or GL failures without caching an
invalid texture.

Update every import caller to handle failure and require a 2D texture
until external sampling is enabled for that display backend.
---
